  "vibe": "Asphalt #26282c and chalk with a courier orange #ff6b35 and a cyan #4cc9f0 reserved for the fast parts. Passion One's condensed poster caps slice in from the right on a twelve-degree skew, and the camera carries skew 5 — the hardest lean in this set. Behind the type the city scrolls: five dark building slabs parallax past at 620px a second, a chalk bicycle wheel spins its six spokes at the lower left around an orange hub, cyan speed streaks flick across, and an orange dashed route crawls down the frame from a cyan waypoint dot. Its beats are dispatch furniture — a needle gauge for ETA, three marquee rails of display type running in opposite directions for the feed, right-edge alerts with draining timer bars, and a chip dragged into a rack slot. The CTA flips to full cyan.",
